  "details": "When preloading worlds, the join button is gone (the loading bar vanishes) and viewing it via the notification shows a generic public instance.  Can no longer use it to remember the world from a dropped portal.\n\nI used this as my main method of getting around so i didn't have to listen to the awful loading music and be stuck in the void for as long waiting for long world downloads, but now i have to remake the portal or get invited to the instance if the portal closed.\n\nAlso the preload no longer skips the download screen, it shows up for a second saying 0 / x MB",
